abla_	heta J(\pi^	heta)=\mathbb{E}^{\pi^	heta} \left[\sum_{h=0}^{+\infty}\gamma^h A_h^{\pi^	heta}(o_h,a_h) 
abla_	heta \ln \pi^	heta(a_h^{0}, a_h^{1}, \ldots, a_h^{K}|o_h) ight] \end{aligned} \end{equation} Further assuming that the policy and POMDP are stationary, the policy gradient takes the form of  egin{subequations} \label{eq:policy_gradient_markov_chain_stationary}  egin{align} 
abla_	heta J(\pi^	heta) &=  rac{1}{1-\gamma} % \mathbb{E}^{\pi^	heta} \mathbb{E}_{o\sim d_{ho}^{\pi^{	heta}}(\cdot)} \mathbb{E}_{a^{0},a^{1},\ldots,a^{K}\sim \pi^	heta(\cdot|o)} \left[ Q^{\pi^	heta}(o,a)
abla_	heta \sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\ln \pi^	heta(a^{k+1}| a^{k}, o)ight] \label{eq:policy_gradient_markov_chain_stationary_a} \ &=  rac{1}{1-\gamma} % \mathbb{E}^{\pi^	heta} \mathbb{E}_{o\sim d_{ho}^{\pi^{	heta}}(\cdot)} \mathbb{E}_{a^{0},a^{1},\ldots,a^{K}\sim \pi^	heta(\cdot|o)} \left[ A^{\pi^	heta}(o,a)
abla_	heta \sum_{k=0}^{K-1}\ln \pi^	heta(a^{k+1}| a^{k}, o)ight] \label{eq:policy_gradient_markov_chain_stationary_b} \end{align} \end{subequations} where $d_ho^\pi$ is the discounted observation visitation frequency, defined as  egin{equation}  egin{aligned} d_ho^\pi(o):=(1-\gamma)\mathbb{E}_{s_1\simho(\cdot)}\left[\sum_{h=0}^{+\infty}\gamma^h\ p(o_h=o|s_1;\pi) ight] \end{aligned} \end{equation} \end{theorem} Theorem~ef{theorem:policy_gradient_for_markov_process_policy} builds on Theorem B.1 in \cite{qsm} and established results in policy gradient theory~\cite{agarwal2021theory}. We provide the proofs in Appendix~ef{appendix:policy_grad_for_markov_policies}.

